# macOS AppleDouble artifacts, created when files are copied over the SSHFS mount
._*

# Hourly probe scripts and one-off scratch, written at the repo root by
# operator automation. They are not source, nothing under src/ or scripts/
# imports them, and two of them carry synthetic Slack-token fixtures that
# trip GitHub push protection on every push.
/tmp_*
